Mode B: EncoderStrategy::Custom(Box::new(EncoderImprovementsCustom {
            content_class_auto_classify: false, ..Default::default()
        })).
        Every other field at the Zenjxl default → equivalent to pre-
        W44-164 production behaviour (Mode A minus the auto-classifier).

